MsgId: \"You are old, Father William,\" the young man said
MsgStr: 

Item:
Id: 783150
MsgCtxt: STRINGS.STAGEACTOR.WANDA1.2
MsgId: \"And your hair has become very white;
MsgStr: 

Item:
Id: 783151
MsgCtxt: STRINGS.STAGEACTOR.WANDA1.3
MsgId: And yet you incessantly stand on your head—
MsgStr: 

Item:
Id: 783152
MsgCtxt: STRINGS.STAGEACTOR.WANDA1.4
MsgId: Do you think, at your age, it is right?\"
MsgStr: 

Item:
Id: 783153
MsgCtxt: STRINGS.STAGEACTOR.WANDA1.5
MsgId: \"In my youth,\" Father William replied to his son,
MsgStr: 

Item:
Id: 783154
MsgCtxt: STRINGS.STAGEACTOR.WANDA1.6
MsgId: \"I feared it might injure the brain;
MsgStr: 

Item:
Id: 783155
MsgCtxt: STRINGS.STAGEACTOR.WANDA1.7
MsgId: But now that I'm perfectly sure I have none,
MsgStr: 

Item:
Id: 783156
MsgCtxt: STRINGS.STAGEACTOR.WANDA1.8
MsgId: Why, I do it again and again.\"
MsgStr: 

